  "id": "grilled-pork-tenderloin-with-balsamic-honey-glaze",
  "name": "Grilled Pork Tenderloin with Balsamic Honey Glaze",
  "subtitle": "Seasoned pork with a tangy-sweet finish",
  "description": "A spice-rubbed pork tenderloin is browned, grilled, and brushed with a simple balsamic honey glaze.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
    "quantity": 8,
